[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3750071963","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114922#issuecomment-3750071963","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114922","id":3750071963,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7fhY6b","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-14T15:22:27Z","updated_at":"2026-01-14T15:22:27Z","body":"@m4gr3d I believe I've refactored this according to what you outlined.\r\n\r\nHowever, I found myself needing to remove the existing LOG output, as it also was a bit of a source of confusion as to where the driver actually comes from. If we do still want to keep the log information, I'd probably suggest further expanding getRendererInfo to output this information and let Godot track it instead of having the Java side pull this information by itself from the command line or the project settings.\r\n\r\nDo you think it is essential to restore the log output and add that information or should we go ahead with what I did so far?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3750071963/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3750239901","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114922#issuecomment-3750239901","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114922","id":3750239901,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7fiB6d","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-14T15:54:18Z","updated_at":"2026-01-14T15:54:18Z","body":"@DarioSamo It's fine to move the LOG output to `getRendererInfo()`.\r\n\r\n```\r\n\t\tval cmdline = commandLine\r\n\t\tvar index = cmdline.indexOf(\"--rendering-method\")\r\n\t\tif (index > -1 && cmdline.size > index + 1) {\r\n\t\t\trendererSource = \"CommandLine\"\r\n\t\t\trenderer = cmdline.get(index + 1)\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\tindex = cmdline.indexOf(\"--rendering-driver\")\r\n\t\tif (index > -1 && cmdline.size > index + 1) {\r\n\t\t\trenderingDeviceSource = \"CommandLine\"\r\n\t\t\trenderingDevice = cmdline.get(index + 1)\r\n\t\t}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe above logic was added in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101050 to allow switching the renderer when restarting the app.. does the updated logic take that into account?\r\nFor example, I'd expect that if I restart the app and pass a different `--rendering-method` argument, `getNativeRenderer()` should return the updated rendering method (if supported).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3750239901/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3750290568","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114922#issuecomment-3750290568","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114922","id":3750290568,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7fiOSI","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-14T16:04:56Z","updated_at":"2026-01-14T16:08:20Z","body":"> The above logic was added in #101050 to allow switching the renderer when restarting the app.. does the updated logic take that into account? For example, I'd expect that if I restart the app and pass a different `--rendering-method` argument, `getNativeRenderer()` should return the updated rendering method (if supported).\r\n\r\nGodot itself already parses these command line arguments. To me it sounds like the Java side was merely trying to follow Godot's logic, because at the time the PR was made, the Java side was only directly reading from project settings.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3750290568/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3750343839","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114922#issuecomment-3750343839","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114922","id":3750343839,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7fibSf","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-14T16:14:17Z","updated_at":"2026-01-14T16:14:17Z","body":"> @DarioSamo It's fine to move the LOG output to `getRendererInfo()`.\r\n\r\nSorry, I did not have my earlier proposal quite clear yet. Would the method we agree on be that we add two extra String outputs to getRendererInfo() to inform the Java side of what Godot sourced the rendering driver from? This also allows it to potentially expand into informing it chose it due to the fallback as well.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3750343839/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3750750487","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114922#issuecomment-3750750487","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114922","id":3750750487,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7fj-kX","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-14T17:33:57Z","updated_at":"2026-01-14T17:33:57Z","body":"> > @DarioSamo It's fine to move the LOG output to `getRendererInfo()`.\r\n> \r\n> Sorry, I did not have my earlier proposal quite clear yet. Would the method we agree on be that we add two extra String outputs to getRendererInfo() to inform the Java side of what Godot sourced the rendering driver from? This also allows it to potentially expand into informing it chose it due to the fallback as well.\r\n\r\nYes that sounds good to me!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3750750487/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3752009607","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114922#issuecomment-3752009607","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114922","id":3752009607,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7fox-H","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSa